/-!
# The native trio pair space and affine quotient

The geometric pair space has dimension nine in the actual Mathieu cocode.
For the standard marking the native affine kernel is the intrinsic two-core,
and the resulting group quotient is L₃(2) × S₃. Concrete natural actions of
both quotient factors specify the tensor target for the middle section.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, H.14.1(3) and H.15.6, printed pp.396 and 401.
Fixed-space and commutator calculations and the tensor intertwiner are not
asserted by this module.
-/
